  "body": "I think this line is wrong, I would have sent a PR, but I've not PR'd into specs before, so I wasn't too confident!\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/WICG/cookie-store/blame/master/explainer.md#L262\r\n\r\n```js\r\n  // By default, cookies are scoped at the current domain.\r\n  domain: (new URL(self.location.href)).domain,\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think `.domain` should be `.hostname`.",
